{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setEmail:completion:","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmail:completion:"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setEmail:completion:","roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","title":"setEmail:completion:"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemail:completion:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Associates an email address with the current device with completion confirmation.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmail:completion:"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setEmail:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"email"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"completion:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":" (^"},{"text":")(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError","text":"NSError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"error","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":")) "},{"text":"completion","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The user’s email address. Must be a valid email format.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"email"},{"name":"completion","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Block called when the operation completes."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Receives nil on success, or an NSError on failure.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Same as ","type":"text"},{"code":"setEmail:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" but provides callback when the server registration completes.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use this when you need to:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Verify email was registered before showing confirmation UI","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Chain operations that depend on email registration"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Implement error handling and retry logic","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Register email during account setup with verification:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class AccountSetupController {","","    func submitEmail(_ email: String) {","        guard isValidEmail(email) else {","            showError(\"Please enter a valid email address\")","            return","        }","","        showLoadingState()","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setEmail(email) { [weak self] error in","            DispatchQueue.main.async {","                self?.hideLoadingState()","","                if let error = error {","                    Logger.error(\"Email registration failed: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","                    self?.showRetryOption(for: email)","                    return","                }","","                \/\/ Email registered successfully - update tags","                let domain = email.components(separatedBy: \"@\").last ?? \"\"","                Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","                    \"has_email\": true,","                    \"email_domain\": domain,","                    \"email_type\": self?.classifyEmailDomain(domain) ?? \"personal\"","                ])","","                self?.proceedToNextStep()","            }","        }","    }","","    private func classifyEmailDomain(_ domain: String) -> String {","        let businessDomains = [\"company.com\", \"enterprise.org\"]","        let educationDomains = [\"edu\", \"ac.uk\", \"edu.au\"]","","        if businessDomains.contains(domain) { return \"business\" }","        if educationDomains.contains(where: { domain.hasSuffix($0) }) { return \"education\" }","        return \"personal\"","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setEmail:completion:":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemail:completion:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setEmail:completion:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmail:completion:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Associates an email address with the current device with completion confirmation."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setEmail:completion:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"setEmail:completion:"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","abstract":[{"text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PWConfiguration","type":"topic"}}}